    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      430.56,
      297.54,
      464.63
    ],
    "text": "NOTICE is hereby given in terms of Section 7(1) of subSection that the Government has decided to acquire thefollowing land for a matter that is necessity to the Public.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.4,
      473.76,
      296.88,
      483.83
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land which is decided to acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      492.96,
      297.5,
      551.03
    ],
    "text": "The Lot No. 01 which is described hereunder accordingto the prime Plan No. 9778 situated in the Village of Pitakotte,within the Municipal limits of Kotte, in the division of SriJayawardenapura Divisional Secretary in Colombo DistrictWestern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      565.01,
      297.32,
      587.08
    ],
    "text": "The boundaries for the said Lot No. 01 describedhereunder",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      590.88,
      297.56,
      612.95
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Madatiyagahawatta; Description ofthe Land: Compound, consists of two permanent buildings",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      322.56,
      561.68,
      344.63
    ],
    "text": "and a two permanent buildings with a three storey building;Claimed by: Cannot be traced; Extent: 0.1317 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      358.56,
      562.27,
      416.63
    ],
    "text": "All those who claimed, servitude, rights, and/or any otherconnections to the above land either by themselves or bytheir documents and/or authorized personnel must meet meon 08.11.2018 at 10.00 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat inSri Jayawardenapura Kotte.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      430.56,
      562.25,
      512.63
    ],
    "text": "Further the nature of their rights to the said land/lands, thedetails regarding the matters of their request forcompensations, the amount of compensation and how theyhave calculated the said compensation must be informed byproducing a copy document in duplicate before the30.10.2018. The necessary Deeds and documents inconfirmation of the Title must be produced at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
